OL,3,ATeen girl charged with murder over
OL,4,Arecording of San Diego mosque attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 17-year-old girl has been charged
OL,7,Fwith murder by aiding and abetting
OL,8,Fafter prosecutors say she recorded a
OL,9,Flivestream of an attack on a San Diego
OL,10,Fmosque that left three people dead.
OL,12,FProsecutors say the girl also published
OL,13,Fa manifesto from two teenage gunmen who
OL,14,Fcarried out the attack on the Islamic
OL,15,FCenter of San Diego on 18 May.
OL,17,FThe teenager, from North Carolina, was
OL,18,Farrested last week and indicted by a
OL,19,Fgrand jury on Monday, according to
OL,20,FForsyth County District Attorney Jim
OL,21,FO'Neill.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
