OL,3,ATeen girl charged with murder over
OL,4,Arecording of San Diego mosque attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpeaking at a news conference, O'Neill
OL,7,Fsaid: "The thought of her going back to
OL,8,Fschool, with the weekend approaching,
OL,9,Fholy days approaching, we didn't know
OL,10,Fwhat she was capable of."
